MID_MV30_01: <SH>
MID_MV30_01_m001: So this is an underworld gate.
MID_MV30_01_m002: Hey. Should we really be getting close to that thing?
MID_MV30_01_m003: (dismissive grunt)
MID_MV30_01_m004: (breath exert)
MID_MV30_01_m005: (murmured surprise)
MID_MV30_01_m006: (thinking sounds/breaths)
MID_MV30_01_m007: (attack exert)
MID_MV30_01_m008: (pained exert)
MID_MV30_01_m009: Enough. 'Tis no use.
MID_MV30_01_m010: It cannot be broken—not by such crude methods.
MID_MV30_01_m011: Not even by one such as you.
MID_MV30_01_m012: It seems the time has come for me\nto take center stage in this drama.
MID_MV30_01_m013: Now then. Stand back...and observe\nas I bring my full power to bear.
MID_MV30_01_m014: Which of us shall prove the stronger?\nIt appears we shall soon find out.
MID_MV30_01_m015: (exert of effort)
MID_MV30_01_m016: (straining exert)
MID_MV30_01_m017: (increased straining exert, then she breaks it with a\nfinal effort)
MID_MV30_01_m018: (panting)
MID_MV30_01_m019: (surprised exert)
MID_MV30_01_m020: (brief stammering exert)
MID_MV30_01_m021: 'Twas no simple thing even for power\nas grand as mine! Ah well.
MID_MV30_01_m022: Right. In any case, I think I shall\nleave the final step to you. Get to it!